        "original_id": "86a66b09-0216-58d4-ac10-18ae1b4c56e0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Hal McRae\n- Organizations: Kansas City Royals, Cincinnati Reds, Major League Baseball\n- Events: World Series\n\nFacts:\n- The Kansas City Royals were founded as an expansion franchise in 1969.\n- Hal McRae, born on July 10, 1945, is a former left fielder in Major League Baseball.\n- Hal McRae played for the Cincinnati Reds in 1968 and from 1970 to 1972.\n- Hal McRae played for the Kansas City Royals from 1973 to 1987.\n- The Kansas City Royals have participated in four World Series.\n- The Kansas City Royals lost the World Series in 1980 and 2014.\n- The Kansas City Royals won the World Series in 1985 and 2015.",
